   "cell_type": "raw",
   "source": [
    "{\n",
    " \"cells\": [\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"markdown\",\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"source\": \"# 04 - Outputs preflight and output control\\n\\nGoal: discover, validate, and safely apply output objects to the IDF.\\n\\n## Methods executed in this notebook\\n\\nCore ACCIM/BESOS functions used in the runnable flow:\\n- `accim.utils.reduce_runtime`\\n- `ef.get_building`\\n- `ParametricSimulation.scan_output_objects`\\n- `ParametricSimulation.autocorrect_output_duplicates`\\n- `ParametricSimulation.discover_available_outputs`\\n- `ParametricSimulation.select_outputs`\\n- `ParametricSimulation.apply_outputs_preflight`\\n- `ParametricSimulation.set_outputs_for_simulation`\\n- `ParametricSimulation.get_output_meter_df_from_idf`\\n- `ParametricSimulation.get_output_var_df_from_idf`\\n\\nOptional reset helper shown at the end:\\n- `ParametricSimulation.clear_outputs`\"\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"markdown\",\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"source\": \"## Step 1 - Import dependencies\"\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"code\",\n",
    "   \"execution_count\": null,\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"outputs\": [],\n",
    "   \"source\": \"from pathlib import Path\\n\\nimport accim\\nfrom besos import eppy_funcs as ef\\nfrom accim.parametric_and_optimisation.main import ParametricSimulation\"\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"markdown\",\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"source\": \"## Step 2 - Resolve inputs and initialize simulation object\"\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"code\",\n",
    "   \"execution_count\": null,\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"outputs\": [],\n",
    "   \"source\": \"PROJECT_ROOT = Path.cwd()\\nNOTEBOOK_DIR = Path(__file__).resolve().parent\\n\\n\\nIDF_FILE = PROJECT_ROOT / \\\"OSM_TestResidentialUnit_v01_onlygeometry_SchNatVent_v2520_high_performance.idf\\\"\\nif not IDF_FILE.exists():\\n\\tIDF_FILE = NOTEBOOK_DIR / \\\"OSM_TestResidentialUnit_v01_onlygeometry_SchNatVent_v2520_high_performance.idf\\\"\\n\\nepw_seville = PROJECT_ROOT / \\\"Seville.epw\\\"\\nif not epw_seville.exists():\\n\\tepw_seville = NOTEBOOK_DIR / \\\"Seville.epw\\\"\\n\\nEPWS = [str(epw_seville)]\\n\\nbuilding = ef.get_building(str(IDF_FILE))\\naccim.utils.reduce_runtime(idf_object=building, timesteps=2)\\n\\nparametric = ParametricSimulation(\\n\\tbuilding=building,\\n\\tparameters_type=\\\"accim custom model\\\",\\n\\tepws=EPWS,\\n\\toutput_freqs=[\\\"hourly\\\"],\\n)\"\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"markdown\",\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"source\": \"## Step 3 - Scan current output objects and attempt duplicate autocorrection\"\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"code\",\n",
    "   \"execution_count\": null,\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"outputs\": [],\n",
    "   \"source\": \"scan_before = parametric.scan_output_objects()\\nprint(\\\"Current output meters in IDF:\\\", len(scan_before.get(\\\"meters\\\", [])))\\nprint(\\\"Current output vars in IDF:\\\", len(scan_before.get(\\\"variables\\\", [])))\\n\\nautocorrect_report = parametric.autocorrect_output_duplicates(warn=True)\\nprint(\\\"Autocorrect report keys:\\\", list(autocorrect_report.keys()))\"\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"markdown\",\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"source\": \"## Step 4 - Discover available outputs from a short test simulation\"\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"code\",\n",
    "   \"execution_count\": null,\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"outputs\": [],\n",
    "   \"source\": \"discovery = parametric.discover_available_outputs(\\n\\treduce_sim_time=True,\\n\\tprefer=\\\"testsimeplus\\\",\\n)\\ndf_meters_available = discovery[\\\"meters\\\"]\\ndf_vars_available = discovery[\\\"variables\\\"]\\noutputs_meta = discovery[\\\"meta\\\"]\\nprint(\\\"Discovery source:\\\", outputs_meta.get(\\\"source\\\"))\\nprint(\\\"Meters available:\\\", len(df_meters_available))\\nprint(\\\"Variables available:\\\", len(df_vars_available))\"\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"markdown\",\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"source\": \"## Step 5 - Select a validated output subset\"\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"code\",\n",
    "   \"execution_count\": null,\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"outputs\": [],\n",
    "   \"source\": \"selection = parametric.select_outputs(\\n\\tmeters=[\\\"Heating:Electricity\\\", \\\"Cooling:Electricity\\\"],\\n\\tvariables=[\\\"Zone Operative Temperature\\\", \\\"Running Average Outdoor Air Temperature\\\"],\\n\\tmatch=\\\"contains\\\",\\n\\ton_missing=\\\"warn\\\",\\n\\tsuggest=True,\\n)\\ndf_meters_sel = selection[\\\"meters\\\"]\\ndf_vars_sel = selection[\\\"variables\\\"]\\nreport = selection[\\\"report\\\"]\\n\\nprint(\\\"Selected meters:\\\", len(df_meters_sel))\\nprint(\\\"Selected variables:\\\", len(df_vars_sel))\\nprint(\\\"Missing:\\\", report.get(\\\"missing\\\", {}))\"\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"markdown\",\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"source\": \"## Step 6 - Apply preflight checks and register outputs for simulation\"\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"code\",\n",
    "   \"execution_count\": null,\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"outputs\": [],\n",
    "   \"source\": \"preflight_report = parametric.apply_outputs_preflight(\\n\\tdf_meters_sel=df_meters_sel,\\n\\tdf_vars_sel=df_vars_sel,\\n\\tclean_mode=\\\"all\\\",\\n\\tvalidate_before_apply=False,\\n\\tvalidate_after_apply=True,\\n\\ton_missing=\\\"warn\\\",\\n)\\n\\nparametric.set_outputs_for_simulation(\\n\\tdf_output_meter=df_meters_sel,\\n\\tdf_output_variable=df_vars_sel,\\n)\\n\\nprint(\\\"Preflight verification keys:\\\", list(preflight_report.get(\\\"verification\\\", {}).keys()))\\nprint(\\\"Simulation output readers configured:\\\", len(parametric.sim_outputs))\"\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"markdown\",\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"source\": \"## Step 7 - Inspect output objects now present in the IDF\"\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"code\",\n",
    "   \"execution_count\": null,\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"outputs\": [],\n",
    "   \"source\": \"df_meters_in_idf = parametric.get_output_meter_df_from_idf()\\ndf_vars_in_idf = parametric.get_output_var_df_from_idf()\\n\\nprint(\\\"Output meters in IDF after apply:\\\", len(df_meters_in_idf))\\nprint(\\\"Output variables in IDF after apply:\\\", len(df_vars_in_idf))\\nprint(df_meters_in_idf.head())\"\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"markdown\",\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"source\": \"## Step 8 - Optional reset (uncomment to clear all output objects)\"\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"code\",\n",
    "   \"execution_count\": null,\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"outputs\": [],\n",
    "   \"source\": \"# parametric.clear_outputs()\\n# print(\\\"All output objects cleared from IDF.\\\")\"\n",
    "  }\n",
    " ],\n",
